  "name": "cargo-hold",
  "description": "A mobile-first narrative space trading game featuring deck-building mechanics and an idle-progression loop. It employs a custom Domain-Specific Language (DSL) and compiler, 'holdsmith', to orchestrate complex branching narrative events known as scenelets. Players manage starship resources, crew morale, and volatile cargo while navigating a post-apocalyptic 'Silence' setting dominated by factions and ancient Prior artifacts.",
